bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Benchmarks</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R23</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">17,921</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">115<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,016</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,764</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">115<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,063</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">112<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">999</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">106</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">112<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">gpu</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">10,278</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">6,696</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">265.8</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">123w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">3,818</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">151.6</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">123w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,622</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">64.4</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">123w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">7,079</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">117.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">123w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">4,791</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">78.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">123w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">2,197</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">36.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">123w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">The Yocto is a 3D-printed acrylic SFF case with complex mesh hole designs and is designed to work specifically with the HDPLEX 250w GaN PSU using a C6 power connector. CPU cooler clearance is limited to ~38mm (Noctua NH-L9 series or Thermalright AXP90-x36). The build uses an i5-13500T with an RTX 4060 Low Profile, with the GPU cooler replaced by dual Noctua 60mm x 25mm fans for better thermals. Component installation order is critical due to tight tolerances. Custom PSU cables from N3rdware are strongly recommended. The GPU requires a CRJ Micro 4-pin adapter to enable GPU temp monitoring in HWInfo64/HWMonitor. Performance is solid despite low power consumption; CPU initially thermal throttled at stock settings but improved after reducing PL2 to 90w. The case is expensive, adds significant cost with custom fans and cables, and is more of an art piece than a practical build, but construction quality is excellent and it performs well as a compact gaming rig.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">17,921</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\" style=\"width:64%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->36<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">155.8</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-sff-red\">-5<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">265.8<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\" style=\"width:48%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->52<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">2.16</span> fps/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">14<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-8\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">ComponentWatch</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-xs\">Community-verified benchmarks and real-world data for small-form-factor PC builders.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-12 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-mut